    "description_html": "<p>A popular aluminum push-button metal ballpen available in a wide range of anodized colors with chrome metal clip and trim. It's part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/metal-pens/\">metal pen collection</a> at Custom Genie.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Precision laser engraving beside the clip</li>\n<li>Laser engraving produces an all-white&nbsp;design*</li>\n<li>Colored metal barrel with chrome trim</li>\n<li>8 different anodized colors to choose from</li>\n<li>Push button action</li>\n<li>Engraving area: 50 x 6.5mm</li>\n<li>Writing ink color: Black</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>* Please Note:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>As these pens are laser engraved rather than printed, your logo or design appears in 1-color white and multiple colors are not available. When you design this pen on our website your text and logos will be converted to 1-color white even if you upload logos or text in different colors. The engraving effect on the white pen is a light grey as shown in the images above<strong><br /></strong></p>"
  },
